          "review": [{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Vaishali Modi"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"A highly rational purchase. It gives you the necessary tech features for connectivity and comfort without forcing you into the costly Long Range battery, which many city drivers don't actually need.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.9,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Manish Hegde"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The new Paddle Shifters for Multi-Mode Regen in the Smart Plus model are a joy to use. I can control the braking force dynamically on the fly, which maximizes range effortlessly.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":3.7,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Sunita"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The unladen ground clearance of 190 mm is brilliant. It handles rough patches and flooded streets during the monsoon without any anxiety about the underbody getting hit. True SUV characteristics.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.4,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Ritu Aggarwal"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"Charging from 10-100% takes about 9.4 hours via the standard 15A plug. This means I must rely heavily on my 3.3 kW wall box charger. Fast charging is available but requires planning.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":3.6,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Jatin Varma"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The Air Purifier and Automatic Climate Control (optional/available) are great for combating pollution in metros like Delhi/Mumbai. It makes the cabin a much more comfortable and healthy space.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.8,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Karan Malhotra"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The lack of alloy wheels and LED projector headlamps still makes it look a bit basic from the outside compared to the Adventure trim. The style upgrade is definitely worth the extra cost.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Karan Malhotra"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The Rear Parking Camera (unique to this variant compared to base Smart) is essential for parking in tight city spots. The Day/Night IRVM is also a small but crucial addition for safe night driving.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Shreya Joshi"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"For ₹11.14 Lakh (ex-showroom), it’s slightly pricier than some rivals, but the 8-year/1,60,000 km battery warranty is unmatched. That guarantee of battery longevity provides immense peace of mind.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Anil Sastry"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The 60 kW motor provides good torque (114 Nm). It's quick off the line, great for darting through city traffic. The 4 levels of regenerative braking are excellent for one-pedal driving in slow-moving traffic.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":3.9,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Divya Pillai"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"I love the connected experience now! Wired Android Auto works seamlessly on the 7-inch screen, and the upgraded 6-speaker sound system is decent for my podcasts and music on the commute.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Gaurav Taneja"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The 6-airbag, 5-star BNCAP safety kit remains the core strength. Knowing my family is safe in a Tata EV that's affordable is the reason I chose the Punch EV. Safety first, always.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.1,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Nisha Kulkarni"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"My family appreciates the all four power windows, which the base model lacked. It’s a basic necessity in Indian summers, and the inclusion here makes the car much more comfortable for the family.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":3.9,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Rajesh Varma"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The addition of the touchscreen and steering-mounted controls vastly improves the driving experience over the base Smart. It finally feels like a modern car and not a stripped-down EV.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.3,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Pooja"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The 315 km ARAI range (25 kWh battery) is fantastic. My real-world city range is around 200-220 km, which is highly dependable for a micro-SUV. The low running cost is genuinely transformative.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.2,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Ayan Mukherjee"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"This is the true 'sweet spot' variant! For a little extra over the base model, you get the essential 7-inch touchscreen with Android Auto/Apple CarPlay and rear power windows. Worth the upgrade for daily usability.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":3.9,"bestRating":"5"}}]

